      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Shared P11 publication policy",
      "items": [
        "P11 extracts shared policy from the actual merged P10 importer; the caller owns its transaction.",
        "Reuse exact canonical validation, profile binding, qualification and immutable storage. The operator identity boundary remains.",
        "New revision receives fresh digest-bound synthetic qualification; never inherits old verification."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Runtime boundaries",
      "items": [
        "No hosting change. P11 runs in the existing API and PostgreSQL.",
        "No worker job, runner execution or PX4 qualification is added. P11 is implemented locally; no deployment is implied."
